      "writtenOn": "2024-12-16T02:06:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Existing field assumes that the `dtbo.img` has a single VM DTBO, which is union of all DTBOs for all VMs in a device. In addition, it assumes that VM DTBO is only used for device assignment. `devices` can be specified to pass sysfs node for assigned device of a VM. Final VM DT is generated by `crosvm` by applying whole VM DTBO and filter-out unassigned device assignment node.\n\nHowever, for AVF unification, the assumption for \u0027a VM DTBO for all VMs\u0027 is asked to be relaxed. There could be a DTBO per VM, so VM DT cannot be generated by the single VM DTBO + filtering.",
      "parentUuid": "e5604893_17a7f612",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 88,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 89,
        "endChar": 21
